'''Keren''' was the largest [[city]] on the [[planet]] [[Naboo]].<ref name="SWE: Naboo">{{EncyclopediaCite|Naboo}}</ref> It was the location of [[Club Deeja]], as well as a pocket of [[Alderaanian]] citizens. After the [[Destruction of Alderaan|destruction]] of [[Alderaan]], [[Princess]] [[Leia Skywalker Organa Solo|Leia Organa]] ventured to Keren to save the Alderaanians there from the [[Galactic Empire]].<ref name="Leia 2" />

